": 42, "seek": 14870, "start": 176.57999999999998, "end": 178.5, "text": " For this my son was dead,", "tokens": [51759, 1171, 341, 452, 1872, 390, 3116, 11, 51855], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.15116072827436794, "compression_ratio": 1.757085020242915, "no_speech_prob": 0.004904509522020817}, {"id": 43, "seek": 17870, "start": 178.7, "end": 179.88, "text": " and is alive again.", "tokens": [50365, 293, 307, 5465, 797, 13, 50424], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.18930389035132625, "compression_ratio": 1.7108433734939759, "no_speech_prob": 0.0002632322139106691}, {"id": 44, "seek": 17870, "start": 180.26, "end": 181.98, "text": " He was lost and is found.", "tokens": [50443, 634, 390, 2731, 293, 307, 1352, 13, 50529], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.18930389035132625, "compression_ratio": 1.7108433734939759, "no_speech_prob": 0.0002632322139106691}, {"id": 45, "seek": 17870, "start": 182.72, "end": 184.48, "text": " And they began to celebrate.", "tokens": [50566, 400, 436, 4283, 281, 8098, 13, 50654], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.18930389035132625, "compression_ratio": 1.7108433734939759, "no_speech_prob": 0.0002632322139106691}, {"id": 46, "seek": 17870, "start": 185.72, "end": 187.89999999999998, "text": " Now his older son was in the field,", "tokens": [50716, 823, 702, 4906, 1872, 390, 294, 264, 2519, 11, 50825], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.18930389035132625, "compression_ratio": 1.7108433734939759, "no_speech_prob": 0.0002632322139106691}, {"id": 47, "seek": 17870, "start": 188.38, "end": 190.79999999999998, "text": " and as he came and drew near to the house,", "tokens": [50849, 293, 382, 415, 1361, 293, 12804, 2651, 281, 264, 1782, 11, 50970], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.18930389035132625, "compression_ratio": 1.7108433734939759, "no_speech_prob": 0.0002632322139106691}, {"id": 48, "seek": 17870, "start": 191.16, "end": 192.85999999999999, "text": " he heard music and dancing.", "tokens": [50988, 415, 2198, 1318, 293, 8898, 13, 51073], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.18930389035132625, "compression_ratio": 1.7108433734939759, "no_speech_prob": 0.0002632322139106691}, {"id": 49, "seek": 17870, "start": 193.33999999999997, "end": 196.56, "text": " And he called one of the servants and asked what these things meant.", "tokens": [51097, 400, 415, 1219, 472, 295, 264, 21705, 293, 2351, 437, 613, 721, 4140, 13, 51258], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.18930389035132625, "compression_ratio": 1.7108433734939759, "no_speech_prob": 0.0002632322139106691}, {"id": 50, "seek": 17870, "start": 197.04, "end": 198.04, "text": " And he said to him,", "tokens": [51282, 400, 415, 848, 281, 796, 11, 51332], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.18930389035132625, "compression_ratio": 1.7108433734939759, "no_speech_prob": 0.0002632322139106691}, {"id": 51, "seek": 17870, "start": 198.48, "end": 199.72, "text": " Your brother has come,", "tokens": [51354, 2260, 3708, 575, 808, 11, 51416], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.18930389035132625, "compression_ratio": 1.7108433734939759, "no_speech_prob": 0.0002632322139106691}, {"id": 52, "seek": 17870, "start": 199.94, "end": 201.85999999999999, "text": " and your father has killed the fattened calf", "tokens": [51427, 293, 428, 3086, 575, 4652, 264, 4046, 1147, 292, 31893, 51523], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.18930389035132625, "compression_ratio": 1.7108433734939759, "no_speech_prob": 0.0002632322139106691}, {"id": 53, "seek": 17870, "start": 201.85999999999999, "end": 204.57999999999998, "text": " because he has received him back safe and sound.", "tokens": [51523, 570, 415, 575, 4613, 796, 646, 3273, 293, 1626, 13, 51659], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.18930389035132625, "compression_ratio": 1.7108433734939759, "no_speech_prob": 0.0002632322139106691}, {"id": 54, "seek": 17870, "start": 205.35999999999999, "end": 208.22, "text": " But he was angry and refused to go in.", "tokens": [51698, 583, 415, 390, 6884, 293, 14654, 281, 352, 294, 13, 51841], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.18930389035132625, "compression_ratio": 1.7108433734939759, "no_speech_prob": 0.0002632322139106691}, {"id": 55, "seek": 20870, "start": 208.7, "end": 211.0, "text": " His father came out and entreated him.", "tokens": [50365, 2812, 3086, 1361, 484, 293, 948, 26559, 796, 13, 50480], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.21505456051584018, "compression_ratio": 1.6276150627615062, "no_speech_prob": 0.00041728626820258796}, {"id": 56, "seek": 20870, "start": 211.5, "end": 212.72, "text": " But he answered his father,", "tokens": [50505, 583, 415, 10103, 702, 3086, 11, 50566], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.21505456051584018, "compression_ratio": 1.6276150627615062, "no_speech_prob": 0.00041728626820258796}, {"id": 57, "seek": 20870, "start": 213.35999999999999, "end": 216.67999999999998, "text": " Look, these many years I have served you,", "tokens": [50598, 2053, 11, 613, 867, 924, 286, 362, 7584, 291, 11, 50764], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.21505456051584018, "compression_ratio": 1.6276150627615062, "no_speech_prob": 0.00041728626820258796}, {"id": 58, "seek": 20870, "start": 216.83999999999997, "end": 219.07999999999998, "text": " and I never disobeyed your command.", "tokens": [50772, 293, 286, 1128, 717, 78, 13502, 292, 428, 5622, 13, 50884], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.21505456051584018, "compression_ratio": 1.6276150627615062, "no_speech_prob": 0.00041728626820258796}, {"id": 59, "seek": 20870, "start": 219.51999999999998, "end": 221.61999999999998, "text": " Yet you never gave me a young goat", "tokens": [50906, 10890, 291, 1128, 2729, 385, 257, 2037, 23608, 51011], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.21505456051584018, "compression_ratio": 1.6276150627615062, "no_speech_prob": 0.00041728626820258796}, {"id": 60, "seek": 20870, "start": 221.61999999999998, "end": 223.73999999999998, "text": " that I might celebrate with my friends.", "tokens": [51011, 300, 286, 1062, 8098, 365, 452, 1855, 13, 51117], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.21505456051584018, "compression_ratio": 1.6276150627615062, "no_speech_prob": 0.00041728626820258796}, {"id": 61, "seek": 20870, "start": 224.26, "end": 226.6, "text": " But when this son of yours came,", "tokens": [51143, 583, 562, 341, 1872, 295, 6342, 1361, 11, 51260], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.21505456051584018, "compression_ratio": 1.6276150627615062, "no_speech_prob": 0.00041728626820258796}, {"id": 62, "seek": 20870, "start": 226.85999999999999, "end": 229.56, "text": " who has devoured your property with prostitutes,", "tokens": [51273, 567, 575, 1905, 16439, 428, 4707, 365, 10293, 270, 1819, 11, 51408], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.21505456051584018, "compression_ratio": 1.6276150627615062, "no_speech_prob": 0.00041728626820258796}, {"id": 63, "seek": 20870, "start": 229.88, "end": 232.23999999999998, "text": " you killed the fattened calf for him.", "tokens": [51424, 291, 4652, 264, 4046, 1147, 292, 31893, 337, 796, 13, 51542], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.21505456051584018, "compression_ratio": 1.6276150627615062, "no_speech_prob": 0.00041728626820258796}, {"id": 64, "seek": 20870, "start": 233.07999999999998, "end": 234.56, "text": " And he said to him,", "tokens": [51584, 400, 415, 848, 281, 796, 11, 51658], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.21505456051584018, "compression_ratio": 1.6276150627615062, "no_speech_prob": 0.00041728626820258796}, {"id": 65, "seek": 20870, "start": 235.26, "end": 238.04, "text": " Son, you were always with me,", "tokens": [51693, 5185, 11, 291, 645, 1009, 365, 385, 11, 51832], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.21505456051584018, "compression_ratio": 1.6276150627615062, "no_speech_prob": 0.00041728626820258796}, {"id": 66, "seek": 23804, "start": 238.04, "end": 240.32, "text": " and all that is mine is yours.", "tokens": [50365, 293, 439, 300, 307, 3892, 307, 6342, 13, 50479], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.17429696681887605, "compression_ratio": 1.3271028037383177, "no_speech_prob": 0.00042387284338474274}, {"id": 67, "seek": 23804, "start": 241.06, "end": 243.78, "text": " It was fitting to celebrate and be glad,", "tokens": [50516, 467, 390, 15669, 281, 8098, 293, 312, 5404, 11, 50652], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.17429696681887605, "compression_ratio": 1.3271028037383177, "no_speech_prob": 0.00042387284338474274}, {"id": 68, "seek": 23804, "start": 244.16, "end": 247.68, "text": " for this your brother was dead and is alive.", "tokens": [50671, 337, 341, 428, 3708, 390, 3116, 293, 307, 5465, 13, 50847], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.17429696681887605, "compression_ratio": 1.3271028037383177, "no_speech_prob": 0.00042387284338474274}, {"id": 69, "seek": 23804, "start": 248.29999999999998, "end": 251.38, "text": " He was lost and is found.", "tokens": [50878, 634, 390, 2731, 293, 307, 1352, 13, 51032], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.17429696681887605, "compression_ratio": 1.3271028037383177, "no_speech_prob": 0.00042387284338474274}], "language": "English"}